{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/624581-2e-request-thread-legion-of-candles-a-k-a-the-around-the-world-section","id":624581,"title":"2e \"Request\" Thread- Legion of Candles (a.k.a- the \"around the world\" section)","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Hunter: The Vigil"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-08-12T13:45:45-07:00","id":624581,"title":"2e \"Request\" Thread- Legion of Candles (a.k.a- the \"around the world\" section)","content":"so, like every other 2ed book up until now, I think we can expect that there would be a chapter which details hunters all around the world, including story hooks and historical background. We can all assume that Tokyo would be in, considering that in every book but Demon it shows up (with the Hototogisu as its local &quot;metaplot&quot;). I've just wondered which places you my forum friends (and enemies) would like to see in Hunter :P<br /> <br /> personally, I would really like to get a New York City setting for hunter, considering that so many modern fantasy stories I've read about take place in there. Outside of the US and Tokyo (which I am really excited to see, considering we get Edo Dark Era) I think that either maybe Egypt or Israel would be an interesting setting, and so does Greece. For something more &quot;far away&quot;, I would take New Zealand or Australia, and maybe India or Congo. Mexico is also a must, considering that it is a Slasher Chronicle and a cult who carries ancient practices of the Aztecs could be an interesting story hook.<br /> <br /> Also, I wonder how the entries themselves would be presented- while some compacts and many conspiracies do reach to the furthest edges of the world, there are many local compacts and semi local conspiracies. While I assume that a few of those entries would present local compacts/conspiracies, I wonder how developed they are going to be- sure, dropping few names and general ideologies is a good way to present ideas and spark homebrew without actually investing too much wordcount, I do hope few would be presented fully. It also makes me wonder if there would be an &quot;easy to produce&quot; template for organizations and their Endowments, like 2ed Changeling gives for Courts (out of similar reasons)<br /> <br /> What do you think?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-12T13:54:35-07:00","id":624603,"title":"","content":"I'd really like to see my native UK as a hunter setting (ok, I <i>kinda</i> embedded it into the Lord Stewards, but it can still be done explicitly).<br /> <br /> Why the UK, two reasons:<br /> <br /> 1) Gun laws. The UK has the strictest in the world, I'm not interested so much in &quot;here's ways to get around gun laws&quot; so much as, what's the Vigil like in a country where people don't have guns.<br /> 2) Bram Stoker, Crowley, Mary Shelly. A lot of the core inspirations behind WoD gamelines were British - and most of the rest are from nearby Europe. It would be interesting to do a Vigil where monsters are, if not public, integrated into society.<br /> <br /> (I think Doctor Who is responsible for the fact it's quite normal to have more integration in British urban fantasy)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":134,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","user":"The Kings Raven","date":". 09-04-2015, 02:44 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-12T16:54:34-07:00","id":624721,"title":"","content":"I would love to see VALKYRIE-equivalents across the globe; how does the Israeli government tackle the supernatural, or the Chinese? There's tons of potential there.<br /> <br /> The UK would be worth looking at, just for how it reshapes the Vigil; where do the monsters hide when every streetcorner has a CCTV trained on it, and how do you fight them without guns? Plus it would inspire me to re-write my conversion of PISCES.<br /> <br /> As a contrast, you might do a city in one of the more lawless corners of South America, where the Vigil falls to desperate individuals and well-armed gangs, the shadows are a little bit deeper, and the monsters have more freedom to operate openly.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-13T03:17:52-07:00","id":625275,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/624581-2e-request-thread-legion-of-candles-a-k-a-the-around-the-world-section?p=624721#post624721\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I would love to see VALKYRIE-equivalents across the globe; how does the Israeli government tackle the supernatural, or the Chinese? There's tons of potential there.</div> </div> </div> </div> China or Israel might very well have their own homegrown government sponsored hunter groups but Valkyrie is a UN taskforce, which means that there are quite possibly Valkyrie teams in China and Israel comprised partially or wholly of natives.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","name":"StSword","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar391_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1635"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-13T06:17:39-07:00","id":625376,"title":"","content":"amm correct me if I'm wrong, but Valkyrie is not a UN taskforce- it is an american organization and is centered in the United States. I'm not saying that it means that it doesn't employ agents in other countries, or that it doesn't use cells made up of locals in order to advance their interests, but it also doesn't mean it has access to anywhere and works freely. It is more than likely that Chinese or Russian agencies work against Valkyrie, and force their agents work under deep cover out of fear of being treated as &quot;spies&quot;. The difference is not a matter of range or resources (after all, the US is the world's leading power and the vampires who fund Valkyrie makes sure they won't lack money) but a matter of attitude. A UN taskforce would try to protect the peace and act as neutrally as possible. An american one would favor the protection of their country first and foremost, and would have to deal with both local monsters and rival organizations.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-13T07:29:01-07:00","id":625476,"title":"","content":"I hope there's a Russian setting too.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/321-sunlessnick","name":"SunlessNick","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1214"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-13T10:14:55-07:00","id":625671,"title":"","content":"VALKARIE is either NATO or UN and thus has an excuse to recruit and act beyond America. Personally though I think it would work best if it was purely American, it would give them more room to do secret government conspiracyish stuff if they worked for America and not a whole bunch of countries with different goals.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-13T13:24:57-07:00","id":625797,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>StSword</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/624581-2e-request-thread-legion-of-candles-a-k-a-the-around-the-world-section?p=625275#post625275\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> China or Israel might very well have their own homegrown government sponsored hunter groups but Valkyrie is a UN taskforce, which means that there are quite possibly Valkyrie teams in China and Israel comprised partially or wholly of natives.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> VALKYRIE is most definitely NOT a UN taskforce. It is a US-led Joint Taskforce. It is international, but it has nothing to do with the UN. As it's based via US allies, it's going to have the strongest connection to NATO in terms of international organizations.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-13T19:52:25-07:00","id":626163,"title":"","content":"Yet it feels nearly wholey american in contrasting to being an international organization","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1381-herkles","name":"herkles","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-13T19:59:02-07:00","id":626184,"title":"","content":"This is not going to a wholly popular idea, but it also makes decent sense.<br /> <br /> I like the idea of following Changeling in terms of regional Compacts...but not Conspiracies.<br /> <br /> Now, a lot of this depends on how that breakdown of Compacts and Conspiracies is going to go, but I think whether it keeps to that or not, we need a set of world-wide organizations contrasted with smaller, regionally based groups.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-13T20:45:24-07:00","id":626247,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/624581-2e-request-thread-legion-of-candles-a-k-a-the-around-the-world-section?p=626184#post626184\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Now, a lot of this depends on how that breakdown of Compacts and Conspiracies is going to go, but I think whether it keeps to that or not, we need a set of world-wide organizations contrasted with smaller, regionally based groups.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thing is though, while we can talk about Conspiracies as &quot;global&quot; - there's clearly a Western power base for five out the core six. So there are going to be some completely different groups in play in (for example) China. Conspiracies are further reaching than Compacts, but that doesn't mean their continuously ubiquitous no matter where in the world you are.<br /> <br /> So I agree that the Changeling model doesn't work for Conspiracies - but maybe something closer to the VtR 2E Covenants model, where the initially introduced ones are far reaching, but others are conceptually introduced in the write ups for certain locals.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-13T21:20:24-07:00","id":626289,"title":"","content":"Fair enough.<br /> <br /> Now, because I just remembered this, I must tread the old refrain: We cannot use other games(Changeling and Vampire) to answer the problems of another(Hunter). Inform, sure, answer, no.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-13T21:29:28-07:00","id":626294,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>herkles</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/624581-2e-request-thread-legion-of-candles-a-k-a-the-around-the-world-section?p=626163#post626163\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yet it feels nearly wholey american in contrasting to being an international organization</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> It primarily is, but just like the American intelligence infrastructure in real life, allied recruitment and resources are involved.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-13T21:33:20-07:00","id":626295,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/624581-2e-request-thread-legion-of-candles-a-k-a-the-around-the-world-section?p=626294#post626294\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> It primarily is, but just like the American intelligence infrastructure in real life, allied recruitment and resources are involved.</div> </div> </div> </div>True, I always thought it was a purely american thing. if it is supposed to be international, perhaps play up the international make up of it. <br /> <br /> That said, I would like to see the vigil in other parts of the world. I nominate india for one location.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1381-herkles","name":"herkles","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-13T23:46:49-07:00","id":626366,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/624581-2e-request-thread-legion-of-candles-a-k-a-the-around-the-world-section?p=624721#post624721\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I would love to see VALKYRIE-equivalents across the globe; how does the Israeli government tackle the supernatural, or the Chinese? There's tons of potential there.<br /> <br /> The UK would be worth looking at, just for how it reshapes the Vigil; where do the monsters hide when every streetcorner has a CCTV trained on it, and how do you fight them without guns? Plus it would inspire me to re-write my conversion of PISCES.<br /> <br /> As a contrast, you might do a city in one of the more lawless corners of South America, where the Vigil falls to desperate individuals and well-armed gangs, the shadows are a little bit deeper, and the monsters have more freedom to operate openly.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ditto, except the Task Force I really want to see is the United Arab Emirates (hell, if the all-call this year has anything remotely related to Hunter, I may even pitch it). I'd also like to see Zanzibar and Dar es Lam since Tanzinia is sufficiently different from a lot of places we've seen while still being accessible. Really what I'd love to see is every continent getting at least one location, and a minimum of American settings (read: two or three. Preferable two with one more in Canada. I suggest Halifax). Nothing against the States of course, I just want to see other regions and peoples get some love too.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-20T19:09:06-07:00","id":634155,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>herkles</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/624581-2e-request-thread-legion-of-candles-a-k-a-the-around-the-world-section?p=626295#post626295\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> That said, I would like to see the vigil in other parts of the world. I nominate india for one location.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm actually tinkering around with that myself if the books don't cover it (or if I don't end up writing a bit myself, I'm might send something in to apply). India's GOVERNMENT Hunter-Conspiracy is definitely one of the independent offshoots of what is now MI-18 in the UK (Canada, Australia, Nigeria, Malaysia, etc all have groups descending from the Victorian DRU) - but it might have pre-British roots that infiltrated in the 19th Century as well.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-21T06:37:28-07:00","id":634541,"title":"","content":"I'd love to see an European Union official Hunter conspirancy (similar to what TFV is in the U.S., although thematicalyy it could be very different).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>LAND OF THE DAMNED: SPAIN (Spanish): </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/3MHWYm\" target=\"_blank\">Land of the Damned: Spain</a>, <a href=\"https://goo.gl/52b0TX\" target=\"_blank\">Kingdoms of Blood: Spain</a>; Cities of the Damned: <a href=\"https://goo.gl/XFMSSe\" target=\"_blank\">Barcelona</a>, <a href=\"https://goo.gl/AXxdgq\" target=\"_blank\">Valencia</a>, <a href=\"https://goo.gl/zkI5a1\" target=\"_blank\">Carthian Constitution</a> (1812), <a href=\"https://goo.gl/5H8M4s\" target=\"_blank\">Three Arrows Pact</a>: <br /> <br /> <b>OTHERS (Spanish): </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/36HngB\" target=\"_blank\">Demon: The Redemption</a>, <a href=\"https://goo.gl/6B9V8l\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Forgotten</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/247-uxas","name":"Uxas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar247_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-21T12:14:21-07:00","id":634937,"title":"","content":"I came up with or found a concept (can't remember) for the EU as an thematically anti-Mummy group of politicians. That said, they were politicians with Endowments who didn't actually fight monsters.<br /> <br /> They were diplomat's to Irem's conquerors and a new empire to Irem's old empire - and thematically saying that no things change, and old enemies can put down their guns and unite.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-03T16:16:23-07:00","id":650718,"title":"","content":"So having looked at where things have been set since OPP took over, I've got one more to add... South America. With the exception of Mummies in Rio, there doesn't seem to anything based there (Yes Dark Eras has the Aztecs, but they were Mesoamerican). So seeing the Hunters of the Andes or the Amazon would be really cool!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-03T21:36:15-07:00","id":650901,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Kings Raven</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/624581-2e-request-thread-legion-of-candles-a-k-a-the-around-the-world-section?p=624603#post624603\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'd really like to see my native UK as a hunter setting (ok, I <i>kinda</i> embedded it into the Lord Stewards, but it can still be done properly).<br /> <br /> Why the UK, two reasons:<br /> <br /> 1) Gun laws. The UK has the strictest in the world, I'm not interested so much in &quot;here's ways to get around gun laws&quot; so much as, what's the Vigil like in a country where people don't have guns.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Pretty much 100% this. Though I'd be interested how they get around gun laws as well, since upkeeping the Vigil is almost always centered around breaking the law and gun laws would be a weird one to not address. Especially since firearms are such a huge advantage when it comes to raw damage dealing coupled with not having to be within striking distance.<br /> <br /> There's a lot of angles here, and &quot;get around gun laws&quot; doesn't have to be &quot;here's how to purchase and subsequently hide your guns&quot;, though that should be mentioned to. How about high-tech crossbows? Perhaps Network Zero has brought the 3d printer to the Vigil, and has a new subgroup dedicated to contacting cells anonymously and supplying them with blueprints? This would also be a great opportunity to uplift a few Compacts to Conspiracy-level groups -- The Union is a good pick, I think, since their forum means their organized on a large scale (even if that organization doesn't include a rigid heirarchy), and Network Zero could make the jump with it's new 3d-printer Victory-Through-Information deal (that I just made up).<br /> <br /> Conversely, I'd really enjoy localizing things. Both through the lessening of global conspiracies and through really pushing the idea of a Cell -- dead-drops, anonymous text messages, stuff like that. Conspiracies are fine overall, mind you -- Cheiron, for instance, does things all over the place, but it's still just based in England (right?). Basically, stress secrecy, and how alone you are in the world of darkness.<br /> <br /> I love it when a chronicle of Hunter gives me that feeling of bitter yet righteous resignation. That if I play my cards right, I can pass on my little candle. But if I go hard enough, I can turn my candle into a bonfire before I do.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/274-enokh","name":"Enokh","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar274_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"474"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}